# [D-NVIM-KEYMAPS] lazyvim.jq is a jq-delta build input that install reads in
# place (apply_jq_deltas onto ~/.config/nvim/lazyvim.json), not a dotfile.
# Without this, stow symlinks it to ~/lazyvim.jq because it sits at the package
# root. Stow replaces its default ignore list when this file exists; the package
# holds nothing else a default pattern would have guarded. See
# docs/decisions.html#D-NVIM-KEYMAPS.
lazyvim\.jq
